    <string name="glass_edges_note_rr">RR style keeps the edge of panels clear, so Refraction and Rainbow show on the volume panel, the power menu, dialogs and pop-ups too. In the open shade the edge stays frosted, because the shade already blurs what\'s behind it.</string>
    <string name="glass_edges_note_catalyxx">Glass with text on it is frosted to the edge, so Refraction and Rainbow only show on clear buttons and sliders.</string>

